{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gaya: The Mystery</strong> is a Korean Souls-like action RPG set in the mysterious ancient era of Gaya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the result of one developer\u2019s long journey of passion and persistence. As a commander of Gaya, the player uncovers untold stories of history and faces unknown threats to protect the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending real historical background with imaginative storytelling, this world reflects the developer\u2019s heartfelt desire to bring the forgotten tales of Korea to life through a modern game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The one who can change the fate of Gaya \u2014 is you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Obtain Combat Qualification","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825510/dfec9f966ff415b9a8e8672604fc977e561215d3.jpg"},{"name":"Obtain the Garment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825510/52aeb69f3659e8ad77c9132a8492ec9c231e3334.jpg"},{"name":"Obtain the Katana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825510/5166ca5e0dcaf79f7a4950b59848cf404f7e5b3b.jpg"},{"name":"Acquiring Heavy Armor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825510/c5393acbf8780af506dc3be2601bb4ef567c5e16.jpg"},{"name":"Eliminate the spies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825510/875aad2956c67c4918ae9e125c03779804dae674.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825510?t=1768183859","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825510?t=1768183859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825510/177035848f0422f840a6f6893254b748e9d4f488/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768183859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic